lly, let me think about where to place it. The file ends with `export PATH=/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin`. I'll append after that line. That preserves all other definitions exactly.\n\nLet me use the Edit tool to append.","signature":"9f96d162d4404c3f887582e0"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"309427d0-58bd-4796-935b-27354ae2a7af","uuid":"371e7ea3-a80c-407d-bfca-08b1e0016829","timestamp":"2026-10-31T18:19:21.400Z","thinking_duration_ms":5457,"thinking_display":"updates"}
